  "why": "The target model for parity with Strata, for gate A9: a mixture of experts under Apache-2.0, 30.5B parameters, 48 layers of 128 experts with 8 active a token, about 3.3B parameters a token. Grouped-query attention (32 query heads, 4 key-value heads, head size 128, so the queries are twice the hidden size), an RMSNorm over each head of the queries and keys, a softmax router whose top 8 weights are renormalized to sum to one, and an output layer of its own. 61.1 GB in bfloat16, twice this machine's GPU and most of its memory, and 122 GB in float32, which is why its reference records a layer at a time.",
